Misty Ridge — third-party material in this film

PICTURE
- Everything on screen is painted in code (film.js); no images, footage or generated pictures.
- engine.js (brush-stroke engine) and paper.py (paper texture) are copied from the Lemo-Opuscar
  library's Watercolor Brush demo, https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar
  Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab) · MIT licence.

FONTS (self-hosted in fonts/, downloaded from Google Fonts)
- Cormorant Garamond — Christian Thalmann · SIL Open Font License 1.1
- Caveat — Impallari Type · SIL Open Font License 1.1
- IBM Plex Mono — IBM Corp. · SIL Open Font License 1.1

VOICE
- Narration: Kokoro-82M text-to-speech, voice "bf_emma" (hexgrad, https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M)
  Apache License 2.0; ONNX export by thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx (runtime MIT).
- Speech check: faster-whisper "base.en" (Systran) · MIT.

MUSIC AND SOUND
- Original score written for this film, synthesised in code: kalimba and nylon guitar by physical modelling
  (Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/pluck.py, MIT), pad and glockenspiel synthesised in mix.py. No samples.
- All foley and ambience (paper brush, pencil, drop, basket, cherries, birds, wind, insects, pour) synthesised
  in mix.py with Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/sfx.py (MIT). No recordings.

CONTENT
- Misty Ridge Farm, its history and its people are invented for this film (the brief's defaults).
